35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The inland clubs slept eight to a room. Worse, whole-building lets have non-refundable deposits. If someone drops out, the rest of us pay for their empty bed.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,"Eight to a room with lights out at eleven. That explains the exhaustion. @Minato, did the duty logs show how much training time was actually lost?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"@Shion, yes, two hours a day. That is a lot. I hope we can find a place with kitchen staff so we can actually train.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Asuka, the transport receipts show 38% of costs if we go far. I need to see if the public beds at 1,100 yen cover the gap.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, eight to a room kills any chance of mixing. I found a third of us can't make the nine AM train without a pre-camp bed.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Misaki, if transport is 38% of costs, the flat fee is a lie. I need to know exactly who absorbs that variable cost.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, if a third can't make the train, we need a local option. I will check the club hall's availability to see if we can stay closer.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, that is worrying. If many cannot travel, maybe we should stay closer? I want everyone to be there and happy.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, staying local cuts transport to nine percent. That is the only way I can balance the books without another deficit.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, staying local is good, but I need to know if we can actually mix. I found a fifth of us never showed up last time.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Minato, if we stay local, the non-refundable deposit risk vanishes. I need to know if the club hall can actually accommodate us without extra fees.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, the public beds are 1,100 yen. If we stay local, does that rate cover the whole stay, or are there hidden fees?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Asuka, I hope the hall is big enough for everyone. I just want us to be together and not worry about money.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, the rate is all-inclusive. No hidden fees. That is the only stable number I have seen so far.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, the hall is booked by three other clubs. We need a coastal lodge to force mixing. I refuse to let us stay separate again.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, a coastal lodge means non-refundable deposits. If someone drops out, I refuse to let the rest of us absorb that financial loss.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, a coastal lodge is risky. I need to know if the sleeping arrangements there are actually better than eight to a room.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, I understand you want us to mix, but I worry about the deposit. I just want everyone to feel safe and comfortable.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, the coastal lodge deposit is a liability I cannot carry. I need a fixed, all-inclusive rate to close the books.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, I accept the risk. If we stay separate, the camp is a waste. I will push for early commitments to secure the deposit.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
